      "contract": "The inspected 10021225c optional branch invokes 100211c80 only after its feature/note predicates. 100211c80 builds a curve using typed LiquidAudio::NoteEvent items and calls 100110c18 at 1002120f8 with the supplied stream, zero offset, curve, source-derived length and flag 1. That wrapper delegates to 10035a0f4; its concrete +0x140 getter 10035a744 forwards the retained input stream +0x140. The concrete kind/bits getters return 2/32. Curve ratios are not a sample-rate assignment.",
