    {
      "id": "PREP-RATE-3",
      "title": "The concrete silence replacement copies the cluster rate and writes zeros",
      "contract": "10047173c tails to 100471604, which installs AXtSilenceStream vtable 0x104481010, retains its supplied cluster at +0x28, snapshots cluster +0x140 Float32 into +0x38 and channels +0x138 into +0x3c. Its concrete +0x140 getter 1004719ec returns that Float32 unchanged. Factory +0xf8=100471948 creates reader vtable 0x104480fc0 with owner at +8 and cursor at +0x10. Reader +0x10=10047152c returns zero for null output; otherwise, in the positive representable request domain, it calls imported _bzero on N*channels*4 bytes, advances cursor by sign-extended N, and returns N. It does not clamp this request against the stored length-like value.",
      "limits": [
        "Only the nonnull-cluster caller branch is material here. Constructor fallback constants do not establish selected project rate.",
        "The output is silence, not resampled source PCM. Invalid counts/products and wider reader lifecycle are outside this contract."
      ],
