      "contract": "10043a574 requires a descriptor and prepared object +0x1f0 provider; provider virtual +0x58 returns a backend. A nonnull backend is wrapped by 10040cf10 -> 10040b6d8 in AXtAudioStream, primary vtable 0x104473bb0. Constructor instructions 10040b820..10040b830 call backend +0x38 and store returned Float32 at wrapper +0xa8. Concrete wrapper +0x140=10040d498 returns this field. Wrapper factory +0xf8=10040bd08 calls backend +0x50, then constructs a reader exposing a secondary interface whose owner points to this wrapper. No comparison against the earlier requested VstDeck rate occurs in these inspected operations.",
